{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zitifono is an adventure game, go boating on the ocean, swim in peaceful coves, find treasures in secret caves and talk with the funny inhabitants of the archipelago to solve the mystery of these colorful islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234820/extras/aceac967e9f7abdb97852f461283a7d1.poster.avif?t=1773389223\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234820/extras/aceac967e9f7abdb97852f461283a7d1.webm?t=1773389223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234820/extras/aceac967e9f7abdb97852f461283a7d1.mp4?t=1773389223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail with your boat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mystical history of these islands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on humorous quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the inhabitants and choose what you say to them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim in the  sea and explore hidden places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry weird statues and activate strange mechanisms! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a cool little train!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open world and find secrets.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro low poly style!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3234820?t=1773389223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773389223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst